# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRUTH BOUNDARY (CORR-005). Publishing any of the following turns the
# benchmark into a lookup table on the day of release: CORE-Bench shipped
# recoverable answers in 20 of 45 hard tasks, and GAIA's public answer file
# let an auditor score ~98% without solving anything. Nothing here may be
# committed. The public development split is exported deliberately by
# crucible.release_build, never by tracking these paths.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Sealed splits: never published in any form.
tasks_sealed/
tasks_chain_sealed/

# Computed answers, tolerances, acceptance sets and grader match patterns.
tasks_public/**/truth/
tasks_open/**/truth2/
tasks_chain/**/truth_chain/

# Worked passing submissions are answer keys in prose form.
tasks_public/**/verification/tests/accepted/
tasks_public/**/verification/tests/rejected/

# Generators reconstruct every instance AND its answers from a seed, and the
# hazard tables enumerate exactly what is planted and where - which turns the
# hazard condition into "did you read the generator" rather than "are you
# careful". Only the documented public-development archetypes are exportable.
crucible/taskgen/archetypes.py
crucible/taskgen/factory.py
crucible/chain/plan.py
crucible/chain/exemplar.py
tasks_chain/**/template.json
